OneTimeUseIdPolicy::usage
├── given the configId was never initialized for this multiplexer
│   └── it should return pinned = 0, consumed = false
├── given the configId is initialized and unburned
│   └── it should return the pinned id, consumed = false
├── given the pinned id has been burned
│   └── it should return the pinned id, consumed = true
└── given a deadline is pinned
    └── it should return the deadline alongside the id and spend
